ontent=\"offense\"><h4>Offense</h4><hr /><strong>Speed</strong><ul class=\"sbcCommaList\" data-content=\"speed\">  <li>Land 40 ft</li>  </ul><br />  <strong>Melee</strong> gore +8 (2d6+9)<br />   <ul class=\"sbcSemicolonList\">  <li><strong>Space</strong> 10 ft</li>   <li><strong>Reach</strong> 5 ft</li>  </ul> <br />  <strong>Special Attacks</strong><ul class=\"sbcCommaList\" data-content=\"special-attacks\">  <li>powerful charge <ul class=\"sbcCommaList sbcParensWrappedList\">  <li>Gore</li>  </ul></li>  </ul><br />  </div></div>    <div class=\"sbcSection\" data-content=\"statistics\"><h4>Statistics</h4><hr /><ul class=\"sbcCommaList\" data-content=\"attributes\"><li><strong>Str</strong> 22</li><li><strong>Dex</strong> 10</li><li><strong>Con</strong> 19</li><li><strong>Int</strong> 2</li><li><strong>Wis</strong> 13</li><li><strong>Cha</strong> 5</li></ul><br /><ul class=\"sbcSemicolonList\" data-content=\"base-attack\"><li><strong>Base Atk</strong>+3</li><li><strong>CMB</strong> +10</li><li><strong>CMD</strong> 20  (24 vs. trip) </li></ul><br />  <strong>Feats</strong><ul class=\"sbcCommaList\" data-content=\"feats\">  <li>Endurance</li>  <li>Great Fortitude</li>  <li>Skill Focus <ul class=\"sbcCommaList sbcParensWrappedList\">  <li>Perception</li>  </ul></li>  </ul><br />   <strong>Skills</strong><ul class=\"sbcCommaList\" data-content=\"skills\">  <li>Perception +12</li>  </ul>  <br />     </div>  <div class=\"sbcSection\" data-content=\"ecology\"><h4>Ecology</h4><hr />  <strong>Environment</strong>   warm plains <br />   <strong>Organization</strong>  solitary, pair, or herd (3-12)<br />   <strong>Treasure</strong>  none   <br />  </div>      <div class=\"sbcSection\" data-content=\"description\"><h4> Description </h4><hr /><div class=\"sbcPreWrap\">\nThe rhinoceros feeds on leafy plants, branches, and even thorny shrubs. Its thick hide is a mottled gray color, and it can run surprisingly fast for a beast of its size. The rhinoceros is notoriously short-tempered and prone to attacking anything it perceives as approaching too closely (generally within a distance of 80 feet-the distance of a single charge-for most rhinos). Rhinoceros Companions Starting Statistics: Size Medium; AC +4 natural; Speed 40 ft.; Attack gore (1d8); Ability Scores Str 14, Dex 14, Con 15, Int 2, Wis 13, Cha 5; Special Qualities scent. 7th-Level Advancement: Size Large; AC +3 natural armor; Attack gore (2d6); Ability Scores Str +8, Dex -2, Con +4; Special Qualities powerful charge.\n</div></div>  </div><hr class=\"sbcBorder\" /></div><p></p></div><br /><hr /><div class=\"rawInputContainer\" style=\"margin-top:15px\"><h2 style=\"text-align:middle;border:none;text-transform:uppercase;color:#000\">RAW INPUT</h2><hr /><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:14px\">    Rhinoceros (CR 4)\nSource PFRPG Bestiary \nCR 4 \nXP 1,200 \nN Large animal  \nInit +0; Senses scent; Perception +12   \nDefense   \nAC 16, touch 9, flat-footed 16 (+7 natural, -1 size)\n\nhp 42 (5d8+20)\n\nFort +10, Ref +4, Will +2   \nOffense   \nSpd 40 ft. \nMelee gore +8 (2d6+9)\n\nSpace 10 ft.; Reach 5 ft. \nSpecial Attacks powerful charge (gore, 4d6+12)\n\n\n\nStatistics   \nStr 22, Dex 10, Con 19, Int  2, Wis 13, Cha 5 \nBase Atk +3; CMB +10; CMD 20 (24 vs. trip)\n\nFeats Endurance, Great Fortitude, Skill Focus (Perception)\n\nSkills Perception +12   \nEcology   \nEnvironment  warm plains \nOrganization solitary, pair, or herd (3-12)\n\nTreasure none   \nDescription\n\nThe rhinoceros feeds on leafy plants, branches, and even thorny shrubs. Its thick hide is a mottled gray color, and it can run surprisingly fast for a beast of its size. The rhinoceros is notoriously short-tempered and prone to attacking anything it perceives as approaching too closely (generally within a distance of 80 feet-the distance of a single charge-for most rhinos). Rhinoceros Companions Starting Statistics: Size Medium; AC +4 natural; Speed 40 ft.; Attack gore (1d8); Ability Scores Str 14, Dex 14, Con 15, Int 2, Wis 13, Cha 5; Special Qualities scent. 7th-Level Advancement: Size Large; AC +3 natural armor; Attack gore (2d6); Ability Scores Str +8, Dex -2, Con +4; Special Qualities powerful charge.\n    </pre></div>"},"cr":{"base":4},"xp":{"value":0}},"skills":{"acr":{"ability":"dex","rt":false,"acp":true,"rank":0},"apr":{"ability":"int","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"art":{"ability":"int","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"blf":{"ability":"cha","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"clm":{"ability":"str","rt":false,"acp":true,"rank":0},"crf":{"ability":"int","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"dip":{"ability":"cha","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"dev":{"ability":"dex","rt":true,"acp":true,"rank":0},"dis":{"ability":"cha","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"esc":{"ability":"dex","rt":false,"acp":true,"rank":0},"fly":{"ability":"dex","rt":false,"acp":true,"rank":0},"han":{"ability":"cha","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"hea":{"ability":"wis","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"int":{"ability":"cha","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kar":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kdu":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"ken":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kge":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"khi":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"klo":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kna":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kno":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kpl":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kre":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"lin":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"lor":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"per":{"ability":"wis","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":5},"prf":{"ability":"cha","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"pro":{"ability":"wis","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"rid":{"ability":"dex","rt":false,"acp":true,"rank":0},"sen":{"ability":"wis","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"slt":{"ability":"dex","