s as secondary attacks. Such attacks are made with a –5 penalty on the creature’s attack rolls, and the animal receives only 1/2 its <em>Strength</em> modifier as a damage adjustment.</li>\n<li>Proficient with no armor unless trained for war. (See <em>FAQ</em>s and <em>Handle Animal Skill</em>.)</li>\n<li>Animals breathe, eat, and sleep.</li>\n</ul>","instructions":""},"tags":[],"changes":[],"changeFlags":{"immuneToMorale":false,"loseDexToAC":false,"noMediumEncumbrance":false,"noHeavyEncumbrance":false,"mediumArmorFullSpeed":false,"heavyArmorFullSpeed":false,"lowLightVision":false,"seeInvisibility":false,"seeInDarkness":false},"contextNotes":[],"links":{"children":[],"classAssociations":[],"supplements":[]},"tag":"animal","armorProf":[],"weaponProf":[],"languages":[],"flags":{"boolean":{},"dictionary":{}},"scriptCalls":[],"subType":"racial","level":5,"hd":8,"hp":22,"bab":"med","skillsPerLevel":2,"savingThrows":{"fort":{"value":"high"},"ref":{"value":"high"},"will":{"value":"low"}},"fc":{"hp":{"value":0},"skill":{"value":0},"alt":{"value":0,"notes":""}},"wealth":"","alignment":"","classSkills":{"acr":true,"clm":true,"fly":true,"per":true,"ste":true,"swm":true}},"type":"class","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":112500,"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.pf1.racial-hd.Item.WJqmmfXscPVpcISH"}},"ownership":{"default":0}},{"_id":"tyBCU19bdDmLkOlX","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf1","systemVersion":"11.11","createdTime":1795125028663,"modifiedTime":1795125031558,"lastModifiedBy":"C7TQ7ZOKBUpwNi2A"},"img":"systems/pf1/icons/feats/endurance.png","name":"Endurance","system":{"description":{"value":"<i>Harsh conditions or long exertions do not easily tire you.</i><p><strong>Benefits</strong>: You gain a +4 bonus on the following checks and saves: Swim checks made to resist nonlethal damage from exhaustion; Constitution checks made to continue running; Constitution checks made to avoid nonlethal damage from a forced march; Constitution checks made to hold your breath; Constitution checks made to avoid nonlethal damage from starvation or thirst; Fortitude saves made to avoid nonlethal damage from hot or cold environments; and Fortitude saves made to resist damage from suffocation.</p><p>You may sleep in light or medium armor without becoming fatigued.</p><p><strong>Normal</strong>: A character without this feat who sleeps in medium or heavier armor is fatigued the next day.</p>","instructions":""},"tags":["General"],"actions":[],"attackNotes":[],"effectNotes":[],"uses":{"value":null,"per":"","autoDeductChargesCost":"","maxFormula":"","rechargeFormula":""},"changes":[],"changeFlags":{"immuneToMorale":false,"loseDexToAC":false,"noMediumEncumbrance":false,"noHeavyEncumbrance":false,"mediumArmorFullSpeed":false,"heavyArmorFullSpeed":false,"lowLightVision":false,"seeInvisibility":false,"seeInDarkness":false},"contextNotes":[],"links":{"children":[],"charges":[],"supplements":[]},"tag":"","armorProf":[],"weaponProf":[],"languages":[],"flags":{"boolean":{},"dictionary":{}},"scriptCalls":[],"subType":"feat","traitType":"","traitCategory":"","racePoints":null,"abilityType":"na","associations":{"classes":[]},"showInQuickbar":false,"crOffset":"","inherited":false,"acquired":false,"simple":false,"summons":false,"disabled":false,"classSkills":{},"sources":[{"id":"PZO1110","pages":"115, 122"}]},"type":"feat","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":212500,"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.pf1.feats.Item.ehqx8txNRGMaNOPt"}},"ownership":{"default":0}},{"_id":"kZD78rVrNScluQMV","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf1","systemVersion":"11.11","createdTime":1795125028706,"modifiedTime":1795125031558,"lastModifiedBy":"C7TQ7ZOKBUpwNi2A"},"img":"systems/pf1/icons/feats/great-fortitude.jpg","name":"Great Fortitude","system":{"description":{"value":"<i>You are resistant to poisons, diseases, and other maladies.</i>\n<p><b>Benefits</b></p>\n<p>You get a +2 bonus on all Fortitude saving throws.</p>","instructions":""},"tags":["General","Sa